  "title": "3-to-8 decoder",
  "tier": "T3",
  "description": "Build a 3-to-8 line decoder with enable. The address levers A2, A1, A0 (A0 = least significant) select exactly one of the 8 lamps Y0..Y7: lamp Yk is lit iff the enable lever EN is on and the address equals k; with EN off every lamp is dark. Library hint (component tier only): a 1-to-2 decoder cell with enable and a signal crossover are available.",
